{"seq":2,"slug":"monitoring-adoption","title":"监控与采纳率追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/monitoring-adoption","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"监控与采纳率追踪\">监控与采纳率追踪</h1><p>版本治理的决策必须由数据驱动，而非直觉。&quot;v1 还有人在用吗&quot;——这个看似简单的问题，需要一套完整的监控体系才能可靠回答。本文建立 API 版本的实时监控架构，定义核心指标体系，构建采纳率追踪的仪表板，并将监控数据与废弃决策流程对接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>版本监控的核心概念包括：版本流量占比（每个版本在总流量中的比例）、活跃消费者识别（按 client_id 去重的使用者计数）、迁移速率（单位时间内从旧版本迁移到新版本的消费者数）、以及数据驱动的废弃决策（基于流量和消费者数据判断何时可以安全关闭旧版本）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本监控架构\">版本监控架构</h2><p>API 版本监控需要在多个数据采集点获取信息，汇聚后形成统一的版本健康视图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 数据源&#10;        A[API 网关日志]&#10;        B[应用层遥测]&#10;        C[SDK 遥测]&#10;        D[客户端注册信息]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 处理层&#10;        E[日志聚合&lt;br/&gt;Elasticsearch / Loki]&#10;        F[指标存储&lt;br/&gt;Prometheus / InfluxDB]&#10;        G[消费者身份解析]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 展示层&#10;        H[版本仪表板]&#10;        I[告警规则]&#10;        J[废弃决策支持]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    A --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    subgraph 数据源\n        A[API 网关日志]\n        B[应用层遥测]\n        C[SDK 遥测]\n        D[客户端注册信息]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 处理层\n        E[日志聚合&lt;br/&gt;Elasticsearch / Loki]\n        F[指标存储&lt;br/&gt;Prometheus / InfluxDB]\n        G[消费者身份解析]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 展示层\n        H[版本仪表板]\n        I[告警规则]\n        J[废弃决策支持]\n    end\n\n    A --&gt; E\n    A --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; F\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; J</pre><h3 id=\"数据采集维度\">数据采集维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采集点</th>\n<th>获取信息</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API 网关</td>\n<td>版本、端点、状态码、延迟、client_id</td>\n<td>请求级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>具体执行的代码路径（哪个版本 handler）</td>\n<td>方法级</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDK 遥测</td>\n<td>SDK 版本、运行环境、功能使用分布</td>\n<td>会话级</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注册信息</td>\n<td>客户端元数据（公司、联系人、合同）</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>人工更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心指标体系\">核心指标体系</h2><h3 id=\"流量指标\">流量指标</h3><p><strong>版本流量占比</strong>——最基础的决策指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TrafficShare_{v_i} = \\frac{Requests_{v_i}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{N} Requests_{v_j}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9445em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6674em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当某版本流量占比降至 0% 并保持 30 天，且通过消费者确认，即可触发 Removed 状态转换。</p>\n<p><strong>版本流量趋势</strong>——按周/月观察各版本的流量变化趋势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>v1 流量</th>\n<th>v2 流量</th>\n<th>v3 流量</th>\n<th>v1 占比</th>\n<th>趋势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>W1</td>\n<td>50K</td>\n<td>200K</td>\n<td>100K</td>\n<td>14.3%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>W2</td>\n<td>45K</td>\n<td>195K</td>\n<td>120K</td>\n<td>12.5%</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>W3</td>\n<td>40K</td>\n<td>180K</td>\n<td>150K</td>\n<td>10.8%</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>W4</td>\n<td>38K</td>\n<td>170K</td>\n<td>180K</td>\n<td>9.8%</td>\n<td>↓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"消费者指标\">消费者指标</h3><p><strong>活跃消费者数</strong>——按 client_id/API key 去重统计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>过去 7 天有调用 = 活跃</li>\n<li>过去 30 天有调用 = 近期活跃</li>\n<li>过去 90 天有调用 = 低频活跃</li>\n<li>超过 90 天无调用 = 不活跃</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>消费者迁移进度</strong>——追踪已知消费者的版本迁移状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[全部已知消费者&lt;br/&gt;N=50] --&gt; B[已完成迁移&lt;br/&gt;N=35, 70%]&#10;    A --&gt; C[迁移中&lt;br/&gt;N=10, 20%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[未开始&lt;br/&gt;N=3, 6%]&#10;    A --&gt; E[已确认不迁移&lt;br/&gt;N=2, 4%]\">graph LR\n    A[全部已知消费者&lt;br/&gt;N=50] --&gt; B[已完成迁移&lt;br/&gt;N=35, 70%]\n    A --&gt; C[迁移中&lt;br/&gt;N=10, 20%]\n    A --&gt; D[未开始&lt;br/&gt;N=3, 6%]\n    A --&gt; E[已确认不迁移&lt;br/&gt;N=2, 4%]</pre><h3 id=\"健康指标\">健康指标</h3><p>版本级别的 SLI（Service Level Indicators）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>非 5xx 响应占比</td>\n<td>&lt; 99.9%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P50 延迟</td>\n<td>第 50 百分位响应时间</td>\n<td>&gt; 基准 1.5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P99 延迟</td>\n<td>第 99 百分位响应时间</td>\n<td>&gt; 基准 3x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>4xx + 5xx 占比</td>\n<td>&gt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>废弃端点调用量</td>\n<td>已标记废弃的端点被调用的次数</td>\n<td>&gt; 0（告警）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"迁移速率指标\">迁移速率指标</h3><p>衡量消费者迁移到新版本的速度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MigrationVelocity = \\frac{\\Delta Consumers_{new\\_version}}{TimePeriod}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">nV</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1263em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4403em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.757em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果迁移速率持续为 0（无新消费者迁移到新版本），可能意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>迁移文档不够清晰</li>\n<li>迁移成本过高</li>\n<li>新版本缺乏吸引力</li>\n<li>通知未触达消费者</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"版本仪表板设计\">版本仪表板设计</h2><h3 id=\"概览视图\">概览视图</h3><p>顶层仪表板应在一屏内回答版本治理的三个核心问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>当前状态</strong>：每个版本的流量占比和健康状态</li>\n<li><strong>趋势</strong>：流量是否在向新版本迁移</li>\n<li><strong>风险</strong>：是否有废弃版本仍有大量流量</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"详情下钻\">详情下钻</h3><p>按版本下钻时应展示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>该版本的 Top-10 消费者（按调用量排序）</li>\n<li>消费者的联系信息和迁移状态</li>\n<li>该版本特有的错误分布</li>\n<li>与后继版本的功能差异对照</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"废弃倒计时视图\">废弃倒计时视图</h3><p>对处于 Deprecated/Sunset 状态的版本，显示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>距 Sunset 日期剩余天数</li>\n<li>当前仍活跃的消费者数和流量</li>\n<li>迁移完成百分比</li>\n<li>预计能否按期关闭的风险评估</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"告警策略\">告警策略</h2><h3 id=\"版本相关告警\">版本相关告警</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>告警</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>响应动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>废弃版本流量突增</td>\n<td>Deprecated 版本流量 7 天环比 &gt; +20%</td>\n<td>Warning</td>\n<td>排查是否有新消费者接入旧版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sunset 版本仍有流量</td>\n<td>Sunset 日期后仍有非零流量</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n<td>确认消费者身份 + 评估延期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新版本采纳率停滞</td>\n<td>新版本发布 30 天后流量占比 &lt; 5%</td>\n<td>Warning</td>\n<td>检查迁移文档和通知覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本健康度下降</td>\n<td>任一版本可用性 &lt; 99.9%</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n<td>紧急修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未注册消费者调用</td>\n<td>无法识别身份的调用超过阈值</td>\n<td>Warning</td>\n<td>补全消费者注册信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"告警降噪\">告警降噪</h3><p>版本监控容易产生噪音——比如旧版本本来就流量低，偶尔的波动不应触发告警。推荐使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>绝对阈值 + 相对变化</strong>的组合条件（流量 &gt; X 且环比变化 &gt; Y%）</li>\n<li><strong>持续时间门槛</strong>——连续 N 分钟满足条件才触发</li>\n<li><strong>消费者级别聚合</strong>——按消费者粒度判断，避免单个大消费者的行为掩盖整体趋势</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据驱动的废弃决策\">数据驱动的废弃决策</h2><p>监控数据最终要服务于决策。废弃决策的数据门槛：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[评估是否可以关闭旧版本] --&gt; B{流量占比 &lt; 1%?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[继续观察 + 推动迁移]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D{活跃消费者 &lt; 3?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[1:1 联系剩余消费者]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F{是否有合同约束?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[法务评估 + 协商]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[启动 Sunset 流程]&#10;    E --&gt; I{消费者确认可迁移?}&#10;    I --&gt;|全部确认| H&#10;    I --&gt;|有人拒绝| G\">graph TD\n    A[评估是否可以关闭旧版本] --&gt; B{流量占比 &lt; 1%?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[继续观察 + 推动迁移]\n    B --&gt;|是| D{活跃消费者 &lt; 3?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[1:1 联系剩余消费者]\n    D --&gt;|是| F{是否有合同约束?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[法务评估 + 协商]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[启动 Sunset 流程]\n    E --&gt; I{消费者确认可迁移?}\n    I --&gt;|全部确认| H\n    I --&gt;|有人拒绝| G</pre><p><strong>关闭旧版本的数据信心指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>安全阈值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>活跃消费者数</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>30 天内无任何调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量占比</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>90 天滚动窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未确认消费者</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>所有已知消费者都已确认迁移或放弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后继版本覆盖率</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>旧版本所有功能在新版本中可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同约束</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无合同阻止关闭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当所有指标同时满足安全阈值时，可以确信地执行 Removed 状态转换。任何一个指标未满足都应暂缓并排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>版本监控将废弃决策从直觉驱动转变为数据驱动。核心能力：多源数据采集（网关日志 + 应用遥测 + SDK 遥测 + 注册信息）、指标体系（流量占比、活跃消费者、迁移速率、健康度）、以及决策门控（所有安全阈值同时满足才执行关闭）。告警策略需要平衡敏感度和噪音——组合使用绝对阈值、相对变化和持续时间门槛。最终目标是能确信地回答&quot;我能不能现在关掉 v1&quot;这个问题。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：监控数据提供了决策依据，但版本治理还需要面向消费者的沟通渠道——changelog 和文档是建立信任的基础设施，详见 <a href=\"documentation-changelog\">文档与变更日志</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监控与采纳率追踪","id":"监控与采纳率追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"版本监控架构","id":"版本监控架构"},{"level":3,"text":"数据采集维度","id":"数据采集维度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心指标体系","id":"核心指标体系"},{"level":3,"text":"流量指标","id":"流量指标"},{"level":3,"text":"消费者指标","id":"消费者指标"},{"level":3,"text":"健康指标","id":"健康指标"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移速率指标","id":"迁移速率指标"},{"level":2,"text":"版本仪表板设计","id":"版本仪表板设计"},{"level":3,"text":"概览视图","id":"概览视图"},{"level":3,"text":"详情下钻","id":"详情下钻"},{"level":3,"text":"废弃倒计时视图","id":"废弃倒计时视图"},{"level":2,"text":"告警策略","id":"告警策略"},{"level":3,"text":"版本相关告警","id":"版本相关告警"},{"level":3,"text":"告警降噪","id":"告警降噪"},{"level":2,"text":"数据驱动的废弃决策","id":"数据驱动的废弃决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"版本生命周期策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/version-lifecycle-policy"},"next":{"title":"文档与变更日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-versioning-evolution/governance/documentation-changelog"}}